Files available on this page for NearlySans v1.1:
ttf.zip - contains four TTF files (Regular; Bold; Oblique; Bold Oblique)
otf.zip - contains four OTF files (Regular; Bold; Oblique; Bold Oblique)
sfd.zip - contains four SFD files (Regular; Bold; Oblique; Bold Oblique)
  The OTF files were generated directly from these SFD files. The TTF files
were also generated from the SFD files, but with slightly different
settings: In FontForge, on the Font Info | OS/2 | Metrics tab, both Line Gap
settings were changed from 100 to 149 before the TTF files were generated. This
value was chosen to make the line height as close as possible to that for Arial
(single spacing) in Office365 Word for Windows.
The OTF files produce a smaller line height in Word, which is the same as that
produced by FreeSans (TTF or OTF).
ACS1996-NearlySans.cds - a ChemDraw style sheet document for use in the
chemical drawing program ChemDraw
(https://revvitysignals.com/products/research/chemdraw)
